This repository contains code derived from third-party projects:

1. Qntology/logis-center — https://github.com/Qntology/logis-center
   Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2026 Qntology.
   - crates/raon-quant/src/kquant.rs: vendored from commerce/crates/ggml-kquant/src/lib.rs
     (commit 1913209). Modified: English docs and Format::ggml_type added; the per-candidate
     weighted error in fit_symmetric / fit_asymmetric is evaluated in closed form (one pass).
   - crates/nlp-nms-router: algorithms ported from commerce/src-tauri/src (see
     crates/nlp-nms-router/NOTICE for the file-by-file list and modifications).
   - crates/zena-nlp/src/stanza.rs: ported from commerce/src-tauri/src/stanza.rs (the Stanza runner for the
     stanza-onnx-export format 2 models). Modified: model folders follow Raon Zena's layout, ONNX Runtime is
     loaded at run time, the Latin dictionary vote and the reqwest manifest fetch were removed, logs go to stderr.
     crates/zena-nlp/tests/stanza_runtime.rs and tests/fixtures/stanza/decode_cases.json come from
     commerce/src-tauri/tests (the dictionary-vote test removed).
   - crates/zena-nlp/src/granite.rs: the ForwardMode::Exact (CLS) forward pass of
     commerce/src-tauri/src/models/embedding.rs, ported and checked against Hugging Face transformers.
   - crates/zena-sds: Score Dynamics ported from commerce/src-tauri/src/utils/score_dynamics.rs and the
     double_center_matrix / exclusive_assign* helpers of commerce/src-tauri/src/utils/ai_utils.rs. Modified: no
     process-global state (an explicit Ledger value), run files folded on open / close with file locks.
   - crates/onnxruntime, crates/onnxruntime-sys: vendored from commerce/crates (a fork of
     nbigaouette/onnxruntime-rs 0.0.14, MIT OR Apache-2.0, with logis-center's `mixed` input module). Modified:
     OrtGetApiBase is resolved from a library loaded at run time (libloading) instead of being linked, the
     build script's download of the official ONNX Runtime 1.28.0 prebuilt is optional and non-fatal, and the
     test / dev-dependency sections were dropped.

2. ggml / llama.cpp — https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml
   MIT License, Copyright (c) Georgi Gerganov.
   The Q8_0 / Q4_K / Q5_K / Q6_K block layouts and the scale packing in
   crates/raon-quant/src/kquant.rs and crates/raon-quant/src/kernels.rs follow ggml's
   reference quantize/dequantize routines so the output is bit-compatible with GGUF readers.

3. KRAFTON Raon-VisionEncoder processor (OpenCLIP-derived), Apache License 2.0 / MIT.
   crates/zena-sensor/src/naflex.rs re-implements the NaFlex resize search and patch layout of
   modeling_raonve.py / raon_vision_encoder/transform.py.
   The expression dictionary data/zena_lexicon.json uses the node format of logis-center's
   commerce/src-tauri/src/utils/bias.json (semantic / bias / prejudice / exact_match); its contents
   are new.

4. Qntology/candle-rocm-vulkan — https://github.com/Qntology/candle-rocm-vulkan
   Apache License 2.0. Used as a Cargo dependency ([patch.crates-io] of candle-core / candle-nn
   0.11.0, and candle-rocm) for the CUDA / ROCm / Vulkan / Metal LLM backends, wired the same way
   as Qntology/logis-center. Not vendored.

5. crates/raon-infer/src/model.rs re-implements the forward pass of KRAFTON's
   modeling_raon1_nano.py (Apache-2.0) operation by operation.

6. sungu-che/noto-sandbox — https://github.com/sungu-che/noto-sandbox
   Apache License 2.0.
   - crates/raon-vision/src/perforate.rs: ported from crates/noto-vision/src/perforate.rs (first-pass
     patterns, minesweeper seeds / cells_to_open, fill_holes). Modified: the fovea is shaped for a PC
     screen instead of a robot camera's horizon; the tests were adapted.
   - crates/raon-vision/src/tower.rs: the sparse passes (forward_sparse / extend_sparse / merge_sparse,
     LayerKv context, MAP-head value path) follow crates/noto-ml/src/vision.rs and encoder.rs, rewritten
     for Raon-VisionEncoder's timm weight layout.
   - crates/raon-vision/src/bank.rs and the contrast heat follow crates/noto-search/src/vision.rs
     (VisionBank prompt ensembling, bias / prejudice scoring) and crates/noto-vision/src/locate.rs.
   - crates/zena-lexicon/src/phrase.rs: split_phrase_list / weighted_phrases from
     crates/noto-search/src/lexicon.rs.

7. KRAFTON Raon-VisionEncoder (timm / OpenCLIP based), Apache License 2.0.
   crates/raon-vision re-implements the vision tower (timm vit_so400m_patch16_siglip_256 + MAP head in
   the NaFlex 1-D mode of modeling_raonve.py), the text tower (open_clip TextTransformer) and the
   tokenizer cleaning (open_clip canonicalize_text); zena-sensor's resize reproduces PIL's bicubic
   resampling (Pillow, MIT-CMU licence) used by RaonVEProcessor.

8. LanceDB — https://github.com/lancedb/lancedb (Apache License 2.0), used as a Cargo dependency
   (lancedb 0.41 and the Lance / Arrow / DataFusion crates it brings). Not vendored.

9. ONNX Runtime — https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime (MIT License, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation).
   Not vendored: the onnxruntime-sys build script fetches the official 1.28.0 prebuilt for development builds,
   and the library is loaded at run time.

